---
manual: list_box.items_style
lines: [3168, 3181]
testability: interactive
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  para "Choose a fruit:"
  list_box items: ["Grapes", "Pears", "Apricots"]
end
----------- test code
refute_equal "Apricots", list_box.text

click_on list_box
click_on "Apricots"

assert_equal "Apricots", list_box.text, "the options drop down when the box is clicked, and one can be picked"
